<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed } from "vue";
import type { ReviewPreviewResponse } from "../../types/review";
import type { ProviderModelInfo } from "../../types/operations";
import AppIcon from "../common/AppIcon.vue";
import AppSelect from "../common/AppSelect.vue";
import ReviewStepper from "../common/ReviewStepper.vue";
const props = defineProps<{ preview: ReviewPreviewResponse; prUrl: string; model: string; models: ProviderModelInfo[]; defaultModel: string; modelsLoading: boolean; modelsError: string | null; submitting: boolean }>();
const emit = defineEmits<{ "update:model": [value: string]; submit: []; back: [] }>();
const modelOptions = computed(() => [{ value: "", label: `服务端默认${props.defaultModel ? ` · ${props.defaultModel}` : ''}` }, ...props.models.map(item => ({ value: item.id, label: item.id }))]);
const additions = computed(() => props.preview.changed_files.reduce((sum, file) => sum + file.additions, 0));
const deletions = computed(() => props.preview.changed_files.reduce((sum, file) => sum + file.deletions, 0));
</script>
<template>
  <ReviewStepper :current="1" />
  <div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">STEP 02 / REVIEW PLAN</div><h1>确认审查方案</h1><p class="title-sub">了解本次变更与执行边界。仅已接入的选项会影响真实任务。</p></div></div>
  <div class="split-70"><div class="section-stack">
    <section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><div><h2>本次 PR 概况</h2><p class="break-anywhere">{{ prUrl }}</p></div><span class="badge success">已解析 Diff</span></div><div class="grid three"><div><small>变更文件</small><div class="plan-number">{{ preview.changed_file_count }}</div></div><div><small>新增 / 删除</small><div class="plan-number">+{{ additions }} <small>/ −{{ deletions }}</small></div></div><div><small>初始分组</small><div class="plan-number">{{ preview.review_units.length }}</div></div></div><div class="facts"><span v-for="tag in preview.risk_tags" :key="tag" class="fact">{{ tag }}</span><span class="fact">{{ preview.excluded_files.length }} 个文件被策略排除</span></div></section>
    <section class="card card-pad">
      <div class="setting-section"><h3 class="section-title">1. 审查深度</h3><p class="section-note">深度预设尚未接入。当前使用服务端只读审查策略，不能在此增加执行预算。</p><div class="option-grid"><button v-for="(item, index) in [['快速初筛', '尚未接入后端'], ['服务端默认', '关联上下文与静态核验'], ['深入审查', '尚未接入后端']]" :key="item[0]" type="button" class="option-card" :class="{ selected: index === 1 }" disabled><span class="opt-head">{{ item[0] }}<AppIcon v-if="index === 1" name="check-circle" :size="16" /></span><span class="opt-desc">{{ item[1] }}</span></button></div></div>
      <div class="setting-section"><h3 class="section-title">2. 审查重点 <span class="badge neutral">尚未接入</span></h3><p class="section-note">后端尚不接受类别优先级；以下类别仅说明设计中的配置维度。</p><div class="hstack wrap"><label v-for="label in ['正确性', '安全', '性能', '兼容性']" :key="label" class="check-chip"><input type="checkbox" disabled />{{ label }}</label></div></div>
      <div class="setting-section"><h3 class="section-title">3. 审查范围</h3><p class="section-note">由服务端策略确定主审文件。自定义选择尚未接入；排除文件仍需遵守上下文访问策略。</p><div class="segmented"><button type="button" class="active" disabled>服务端自动范围</button><button type="button" disabled>选择文件 · 待接入</button></div><label v-for="file in preview.changed_files" :key="file.file_path" class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" class="file-check" :checked="file.included" disabled /><span class="min0"><strong class="mono break-anywhere">{{ file.file_path }}</strong><small>{{ file.included ? file.classifications.join(' · ') || '已纳入初始预览' : file.excluded_reason || '服务端已排除' }}</small></span><span class="file-meta">+{{ file.additions }} / −{{ file.deletions }}</span></label></div>
      <div class="setting-section"><h3 class="section-title">4. 资源约束 <span class="badge neutral">服务端强制</span></h3><p class="section-note">每轮调用、Token 和时限由后端配置。当前预览未返回新运行时的有效限额，不能在此调整。</p><label class="budget-row" for="unavailable-calls"><span>最大模型调用次数</span><strong>未返回</strong></label><input id="unavailable-calls" type="range" disabled aria-label="调用上限尚未接入" /><label class="budget-row" for="unavailable-time"><span>最大等待时间</span><strong>未返回</strong></label><input id="unavailable-time" type="range" disabled aria-label="等待时限尚未接入" /></div>
      <details class="setting-section"><summary class="link"><AppIcon name="settings" :size="16" />高级模型设置</summary><div class="space-top"><label class="field-label">执行模型</label><AppSelect :model-value="model" :options="modelOptions" :disabled="modelsLoading || submitting" aria-label="执行模型" @update:model-value="emit('update:model', $event)" /><p class="field-hint">模型选择会传入创建接口并冻结到任务配置。预览估算仍使用服务端默认模型。</p><p v-if="modelsError" class="input-error">{{ modelsError }}</p></div></details>
    </section>
  </div><aside class="plan-aside"><section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><div><h2>方案摘要</h2><p>当前接口支持的真实执行配置</p></div><AppIcon name="settings" /></div><div v-for="item in [['审查方式', '服务端默认 · 只读'], ['主审范围', `${preview.included_file_count} / ${preview.changed_file_count} 个预览文件`], ['执行模型', model || defaultModel || '服务端默认'], ['调用 / 时限上限', '服务端配置，预览未返回']]" :key="item[0]" class="aside-stat"><span class="muted">{{ item[0] }}</span><strong class="break-anywhere">{{ item[1] }}</strong></div><div class="divider" /><h3>初始预览分组</h3><details v-for="unit in preview.review_units" :key="unit.id" class="plan-file"><summary>{{ unit.changed_symbols[0] || unit.primary_files[0] || unit.id }}</summary><p class="small muted">{{ unit.grouping_reason }}</p><code class="small">{{ unit.primary_files.length }} 主审 · {{ unit.related_files.length }} 关联</code></details><div class="notice space-top"><AppIcon name="info" /><div>预览仅提供确定性初始规划，不是新运行时的锁定方案或总费用预测。创建时会重新解析 PR；Head 变化会导致范围改变。</div></div><p v-for="warning in preview.warnings" :key="warning" class="small input-error">{{ warning }}</p><div class="plan-cta"><button type="button" class="btn primary" :disabled="submitting" @click="emit('submit')"><AppIcon name="play" :size="16" />{{ submitting ? '正在创建…' : '按服务端策略开始审查' }}</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary" :disabled="submitting" @click="emit('back')">返回修改 PR 链接</button></div></section></aside></div>
</template>
